-- #82 Our nonprofit nonstock corporation: "the board" reads as the governing body.
#ASSERT `How is a reference in section 141 to the board, to a director, to stockholders or to stock read for my nonstock corporation` `a reference in section 141 to the board of directors` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` FALSE EQUALS JUST `the governing body of the corporation, under s 141(j)`
-- #82 "Stockholders" reads as the members.
#ASSERT `How is a reference in section 141 to the board, to a director, to stockholders or to stock read for my nonstock corporation` `a reference in section 141 to stockholders` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` FALSE EQUALS JUST `the members of the corporation, under s 141(j)`
-- #82 "Stock" reads as memberships for a nonprofit nonstock corporation.
#ASSERT `How is a reference in section 141 to the board, to a director, to stockholders or to stock read for my nonstock corporation` `a reference in section 141 to stock, capital stock, or shares thereof` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` FALSE EQUALS JUST `memberships of a nonprofit nonstock corporation, under s 141(j)`
-- #82 "Stock" reads as membership interests for another nonstock corporation.
#ASSERT `How is a reference in section 141 to the board, to a director, to stockholders or to stock read for my nonstock corporation` `a reference in section 141 to stock, capital stock, or shares thereof` `a nonstock corporation with membership interests` FALSE EQUALS JUST `membership interests of a nonstock corporation that is not a nonprofit nonstock corporation, under s 141(j)`
-- #82 A stock corporation: the deeming rule does not apply.
#ASSERT `How is a reference in section 141 to the board, to a director, to stockholders or to stock read for my nonstock corporation` `a reference in section 141 to the board of directors` `a stock corporation` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- #82 The certificate provides otherwise.
#ASSERT `How is a reference in section 141 to the board, to a director, to stockholders or to stock read for my nonstock corporation` `a reference in section 141 to the board of directors` `a nonprofit nonstock corporation that is not charitable` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

