-- #124 Exactly half in favor: not a majority.
#ASSERT `Did the disinterested stockholders approve or ratify the act or transaction by an informed, uncoerced, affirmative vote of a majority of the votes cast` FALSE TRUE TRUE 100 50 0 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
