-- #124 The vote was coerced.
#ASSERT `Did the disinterested stockholders approve or ratify the act or transaction by an informed, uncoerced, affirmative vote of a majority of the votes cast` FALSE TRUE FALSE 100 90 0 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- #124 A section 251(h) offer: 600 of 1,000 shares accepted.
#ASSERT `Did the disinterested stockholders approve or ratify the act or transaction by an informed, uncoerced, affirmative vote of a majority of the votes cast` TRUE TRUE TRUE 0 0 600 400 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- #124 A section 251(h) offer: 500 of 1,000 shares accepted.
#ASSERT `Did the disinterested stockholders approve or ratify the act or transaction by an informed, uncoerced, affirmative vote of a majority of the votes cast` TRUE TRUE TRUE 0 0 500 500 EQUALS JUST FALSE
