-- #125 Only one of three disinterested directors in favor.
#ASSERT `Did the disinterested directors authorize the act or transaction as the Law requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE 3 1 5 3 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- #125 Exactly half of four disinterested directors in favor.
#ASSERT `Did the disinterested directors authorize the act or transaction as the Law requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE 4 2 7 4 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- #125 The material facts were not disclosed to the board.
#ASSERT `Did the disinterested directors authorize the act or transaction as the Law requires` FALSE TRUE TRUE 3 3 5 3 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- #125 The board acted in bad faith.
#ASSERT `Did the disinterested directors authorize the act or transaction as the Law requires` TRUE FALSE TRUE 3 3 5 3 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- #125 A majority of the directors are not disinterested and no committee of two approved.
