-- #125 A majority are not disinterested but a committee of two disinterested directors approved.
#ASSERT `Did the disinterested directors authorize the act or transaction as the Law requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE 2 2 5 2 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
